Based on upstream commit ac773de47aa7834620607e70c18941d1c3844f49.
Upstream licensing and copyright are retained. This fork modifies:

  storage/src/qmdb/sync/engine.rs
      Preserves eligible sync work across target updates, refreshes moved
      boundaries, holds near-complete targets until reached, and retries
      source-local pruning hints.

  storage/src/qmdb/sync/source.rs
      Adds the Response::Pruned wire variant and its codec.

  glue/src/stateful/db/p2p/actor.rs
      Accepts source-local pruning responses.

  glue/src/dkg/reshare/application.rs
      Retries pending epoch-info derivation during boundary verification.

  storage/src/qmdb/keyless/sync/tests.rs
      Verifies retained boundary responses and pinned nodes across target
      updates and root eviction for MMR and MMB.
